config: default branch: develop (from vcs.default_branch in .smelt/config.json)
host: default branch: hostb (from the code host)
origin-head: default branch: headb (from origin/HEAD)
upstream-head: default branch: devel (from upstream/HEAD)
remote: default branch: trunk (from the remote)
only-branch: default branch: main (from the only origin branch)
unknown: the repository's default branch is unknown; set "vcs": {"default_branch": "<name>"} in .smelt/config.json
